<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Hamburg Guide: 13 places – fish market, harbour, Speicherstadt &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>4. St Michael’s (Michel) &amp; tower view</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the lift up and plan the visit on a clear morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>9.97889,53.54843,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Reeperbahn, St Pauli &amp; Beatles-Platz</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the evening, keep valuables in view and avoid lure offers. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>9.95745,53.54964,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Alster, Jungfernstieg &amp; town hall</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Walk around the Außenalster and take a break by the water. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>9.9934,53.5521,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Speicherstadt</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come at the blue hour and pass by the Wasserschloss. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>9.98698,53.54401,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Old Elbe Tunnel – on foot under the Elbe</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Walk through the tunnel in the evening and photograph the skyline from the other side. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>9.9666,53.54587,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Blankenese – stair quarter &amp; Elbe beach</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Take the S-Bahn and walk down the stair quarter to the beach. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>9.80802,53.55732,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Planten un Blomen &amp; water-light concerts</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come on a summer evening for the water-light concerts. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>9.98133,53.56196,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Miniatur Wunderland</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book tickets online and come early in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>9.98894,53.54382,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Hamburg food: fish rolls, labskaus &amp; franzbrötchen</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Eat a fish roll at the harbour and a franzbrötchen with coffee. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>9.97069,53.54608,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>13. Schanzenviertel – Schulterblatt &amp; Rote Flora</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Take the S-/U-Bahn to Sternschanze – Schulterblatt is two minutes away. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/hamburg/#o13</description><Point><coordinates>9.9619,53.5622,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
